sequenceDiagram
  actor U as User
  participant S as Syncer
  participant F as FsCheck
  participant R as rsync
  participant T as TargetReport
  U->>S: mediatools sync SOURCE [TARGET]
  opt no TARGET
    S->>U: list mounted disks, ask
    U-->>S: choice (remembered)
  end
  S->>F: nested? fs type? hard-link test
  F-->>S: ok
  S->>R: -aHu --no-inc-recursive --dry-run -i
  R-->>S: itemized changes
  S->>U: new / update / hard links - start?
  U-->>S: y
  S->>R: real run (progress, log file)
  S->>T: files only in TARGET
  T-->>S: unique / duplicate / hardlinked
  S->>U: report path (nothing deleted)
